[{"title":"花月吟效连珠体十一首 其六","author":"唐寅","text":"花发千枝月一轮，天将花月付闲身；或为月主为花主，才作花宾又月宾。\n月下花会我留酌，花前月不厌人贫；好花好月知多少？\n弄月吟花有几人？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花月吟效连珠体十一首 其七","author":"唐寅","text":"花香月色两相宜，惜月怜花卧转迟；月落漫凭花送酒，花残还有月催诗。\n隔花窥月无多影，带月看花别样姿；多少花前月下客，年年和月醉花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花月吟效连珠体十一首 其八","author":"唐寅","text":"有花无月恨茫茫，有月无花恨转长；花美似人临月镜，月明如水照花香。\n扶筇月下寻花步，携酒花前带月尝；如此好花如此月，莫将花月作寻常。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花月吟效连珠体十一首 其九","author":"唐寅","text":"花开烂漫月光华，月思花情共一家；月为照花来院落，花因随月上窗纱。\n十分皓色花输月，一径幽香月让花；花月世间成二美，傍花赏月酒须赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花月吟效连珠体十一首 其十","author":"唐寅","text":"一庭花月正春宵，花气芬芳月正饶；风动花枝探月影，天开月镜照花妖。\n月中漫击催花鼓，花下轻传弄月箫；只恐月沉花落后，月台香榭两萧条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花月吟效连珠体十一首 其十一","author":"唐寅","text":"春花秋月两相宜，月竞光华花竞姿；花发月中香满树，月笼花外影交枝。\n梅花月落江南梦，桂月花传郢北词；花却何情月何意？\n我随花月泛金卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"满树天香书掩门，无端春意褪红焜。\n恩情只在牙床上，闲刹香闺两绣墩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花溪渔隐图","author":"唐寅","text":"湖上桃花坞，扁舟信往还。\n浦中浮乳鸭，木抄屾平山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迟归","author":"唐寅","text":"大雪寻梅好写诗，隔江友家泛金卮。\n因观赤壁两篇赋，不觉苏州夜半时。\n城上将军原有令，江南才子本无知。\n贤侯若问真消息，也有声名在凤池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"事茗图","author":"唐寅","text":"日长何所事，茗碗自赉持。\n料得南窗下，清风满鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"函关雪霁图","author":"唐寅","text":"函关雪霁旅人稠，轻载驴骡重载牛。\n科斗店前山积铁，蛤蟆陵下洒倾酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀诗","author":"唐寅","text":"郁郁梁楝姿，落落璠玙器。\n空山岁历晚，冰霰义如至。\n朽腐何足论，壮哉风云气。\n书生空白头，三叹横流涕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀诗","author":"唐寅","text":"灌木寒声集，丛筱静色深。\n冰霜岁聿暮，方昭君子心。\n射干蔽豫章，慨惜自古今。\n嶰谷失黄钟，大雅变正音。\n为子酌大斗，为我调鸣琴。\n仰偃草木间，世道随浮沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸡诗，题金鸡报晓图 其一","author":"唐寅","text":"武距文冠五色翎，一声啼散满天星；铜壶玉漏金门下，多少王侯勒马听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸡诗，题金鸡报晓图 其二","author":"唐寅","text":"头上红冠不用裁，满身雪白走将来；平生不敢轻言语，一叫千门万户开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鸡诗，题金鸡报晓图 其三","author":"唐寅","text":"血染冠头锦做翎，昂昂气象羽毛新；大明门外朝天客，立马先听第一声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松竹图","author":"唐寅","text":"促席坐鸣琴，写我平生心。\n平生固如此，松竹谐素音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"版筑求贤图","author":"唐寅","text":"圣主求贤按画图，顷将天秩界胥徙。\n精神不是能玄会，颜色安知非滥竽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画盆石菖蒲","author":"唐寅","text":"水养灵苗石养根，根苗都在小池盆。\n青青不老真仙草，别有阳春雨露恩。\n早起虚庭赋考盘，稻田新纳十分宽。\n呼童摘取菖蒲叶，验到秋来白露团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅屋风清图","author":"唐寅","text":"茅屋风清槐影高，白头并坐讲离骚。\n怀贤欲鼓猗兰操，有客携琴过小桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诗赠宁王","author":"唐寅","text":"信口吟成四韵诗，自家计较说和谁？\n白头也好簪花朵，明月难将照酒厄。\n得一日闲无量福，作千年调笑人痴；是非满日纷纷事，问我如何总不知？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贫士吟","author":"唐寅","text":"十朝风雨若昏迷，八口妻孥并告饥。\n信是老天真戏我，无人来买扇头诗。\n青山白发老痴顽，笔砚生涯苦食艰。\n湖上水田人不要，谁来买我画中山。\n荒村风雨杂鸡鸣，轑釜朝厨愧老妻。\n谋写一枝新竹卖，市中笋价贱如泥。\n书画诗文总不工，偶然生计寓其中。\n肯嫌斗栗囊钱少，也济先生一日穷。\n白板门扉红槿篱，比邻鹅鸭对妻儿。\n天然兴趣难摹写，三日无烟不觉饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青山读书图","author":"唐寅","text":"湖州得娟俱充袜，我把轻缣试高揭。\n东涂西抹出天涯，管领烟霞主风月。\n人家联络住青山，良朋好友时往还。\n读书比比不出户，柴门流水声潺湲。\n危椒绝磴走行旅，岚气湿衣云作侣。\n山腰隐隐见招提，落日长途渺何许。\n林坳树底跨浮漂，一泉玉泻秋琳琅。\n荷衣凉透忍不得，寒郊瘦岛谁争强。\n遥天两两沙鸥起，中有昊船过越水。\n轻帆带影掠双凫，顷刻钱塘三百里。\n平生吾亦信吾痴，抽身欲往良不疑。\n酒家急就浅磈磊，取醉还酬个里诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临流试琴图","author":"唐寅","text":"酒罢茶余思兀然，未能除得旧琴缘。\n临流试罢金徽拂，流水冷冷写七弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南游图","author":"唐寅","text":"江上春风吹嫩榆，扶琴送子曳长裙。\n相逢若有知音者，随地芟茅好结庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫妃夜游图","author":"唐寅","text":"融融温暖香肌体，牡丹芍药都难比。\n钗垂宝髻甚娇羞，花雪飞散青霄里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思秋香","author":"唐寅","text":"想煞你，当初一见好至诚。\n想煞你，身材苗条脸儿俊。\n想煞你，花月下好句联吟。\n想煞你，叫着小名儿低声应。\n想煞你，临别前苦叮宁。\n这衷肠事儿略略诉，却落得眼睁睁。\n眼睁睁望着灯前壁上，壁上形怜影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔阳送别图","author":"唐寅","text":"寂寞浔阳白司马，青袗掩骭官僚下。\n献纳亲会批逆鳞，忽以谗言弃于野。\n当时藩镇在谋逆，谋以如公不易得。\n欲济时难须异才，琐尾小人有何益。\n谠言不用时事危，忠臣志士最堪悲。\n一曲琵琶泪如把，况是秋风送别时。\n是非公论日纷纷，不在朝廷在野人。\n他日江州茅屋底，年年伏腊赛鸡豚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人图","author":"唐寅","text":"只为怜春色，新红折一枚。\n余香盈翠袖，偏惹蝶蜂随。\n梦断碧纱橱，窗外闻鹈鴃。\n清怨托琵琶，怨极终难说。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人图","author":"唐寅","text":"鸾钗压鬓髻偏新，雾湿云低别种情。\n最是含羞无那意，故将结发试穿针。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香柳娘","author":"唐寅","text":"隔帘栊鸟声，隔帘栊鸟声，把人惊觉。\n梦回蝴蝶巫山庙。\n我心中恨着，我心中恨着。\n云散楚峰高，凤去秦楼悄。\n怕今宵琴瑟，怕今宵琴瑟。\n你在在何方弄调，撇得我纱窗月晓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"席上答王履吉","author":"唐寅","text":"我观古昔之英雄，慷慨然诺杯酒中。\n义重生轻死知己，所以与人成大功。\n我观今日之才彦，交不以心惟以面。\n面前斟酒酒未寒，面未变时心已变。\n区区已作老村庄，英雄才彦不敢当。\n但恨今人不如古，高歌伐木天沧浪。\n感君称我为奇士，又言天下无相似。\n庸庸碌碌我何奇，有酒与君斟酌之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"恩仇","author":"唐寅","text":"恩多成怨，悔只悔，当初不识风流面。\n恩变作仇，顿忘了神前咒，她待要罢手，我何曾开口。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花雨过图","author":"唐寅","text":"桃花雨过水连天，古树高岸乱玉泉。\n独立溪头穷物理，不知斜日落平川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花庵歌","author":"唐寅","text":"桃花坞里桃花庵，桃花庵下桃花仙；桃花仙人种桃树，又摘桃花卖酒钱。\n酒醒只在花前坐，酒醉换来花下眠；半醒半醉日复日，花落花开年复年。\n但愿老死花酒间，不愿鞠躬车马前；车尘马足富者趣，酒盏花枝贫者缘。\n若将富贵比贫贱，一在平地一在天；若将贫贱比车马，他得驱驰我得闲。\n别人笑我忒疯癫，我笑别人看不穿；不见五陵豪杰墓，无花无酒锄做田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流水诗","author":"唐寅","text":"浅浅水，长悠悠，来无尽，去无休。\n曲曲折折向东流，山山岭岭难阻留。\n问伊奔腾何时歇，不到大海不回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"爱菜词","author":"唐寅","text":"菜之味兮不可轻，人无此味将何行？\n士知此位事业成，农知此味食廪盈。\n技知此味艺业精，商知此味货利增。\n但愿人人知此味，此味安能别苍生？\n我爱菜，人爱肉，肉多不入贤人腹。\n厨中有碗黄齑粥，三生自有清闲福。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铅华梦","author":"唐寅","text":"十载铅华梦一场，都将心事付沧浪。\n内园歌舞黄金画，南国飘雪白发长。\n满榻乱书尘漠漠，数声笛月苍苍。\n不才赢得腰堪扎，痛对绯桃检药方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔家乐","author":"唐寅","text":"世泰时丰刍米贱，买酒颇有青铜钱。\n夕阳半落风浪舞，舟船入港无危颠。\n烹鲜热酒招舍己，沧浪迭唱仿扣舷。\n醉来举盏酹明月，自谓此乐能通仙。\n遥望黄尘道中客，富贵于我如云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵问答歌","author":"唐寅","text":"渔翁舟泊东海边，樵夫家住西山里。\n两人活计山水中，东西路隔万千里。\n忽然一日来相逢，满头短发皆蓬松。\n盘桓坐到日灼午，互相话说情何浓。\n一云深山有大木，中有猛虎吃人肉。\n不如平原采短薪，无虑无忧更无辱。\n一云江水有巨鳞，滔天波浪惊刹人。\n不如芦花水清浅，波涛不作无怨心。\n吾今与汝要知止，凡事中间要谨始。\n生意宜从稳处求，莫入高山与深水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪山会琴图","author":"唐寅","text":"雪满空山晓会琴，耸肩驴背自长路。\n乾坤千古兴亡迹，公是公非总陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":914,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游镇江登金山、焦山","author":"唐寅","text":"人间道路江南北，地上风波世古今；春日客途悲白发，给园兵燹废黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":915,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花图咏","author":"唐寅","text":"春归不得驻须臾，恙落宁知剩有无。\n新草漫生天际绿，衰颜又改镜中朱。\n映门未遇偷香椽，坠溷番成逐臭夫。\n无恨伤心多少泪，朝来枕上眼应枯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":916,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花图咏","author":"唐寅","text":"溪水东流日转西，杏花零落草萋迷。\n山翁既醒已然醉，野鸟如歌复似啼。\n六代寝陵埋国媛，五陵车马斗家姬。\n邻东谢却看花伴，陌上无心手共携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":917,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和石田先生落花诗（二十首） 其四","author":"唐寅","text":"桃花净尽杏花空，开落年年约略同。\n自是节临三月暮，何须人恨五更风。\n扑檐直破帘衣碧，上砌如欺地锦红。\n拾向砑罗方帕里，鸳鸯一对共当中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":918,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葛仙图","author":"唐寅","text":"三天门吏葛长庚，体坐蟾蜍赤脚行。\n游遍九州岛人不识，丹台箓上已标名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":919,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嗅花观音图","author":"唐寅","text":"拈花微笑破檀唇，悟得尘埃色身相。\n办取星冠与霞帔，天台明月礼仙真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":920,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉诗","author":"唐寅","text":"碧桃花树下，大脚墨婆浪。\n未说铜钱起，先铺芦席床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":921,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"震泽烟树图","author":"唐寅","text":"大江之东水为国，其间巨浸称震泽。\n泽中有山七十二，夫椒最大居其一。\n夫椒山人耿敬霁，与我十年为旧识。\n昼耕夜读古人书，青天仰面无惭色。\n令我图其所居景，烟树茫茫浑水墨。\n我也奔驰名利人，老来静拂尘埃迹。\n相期与君老湖上，香饭鱼羹首同白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":922,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题伍子胥庙壁","author":"唐寅","text":"白马曾骑踏海潮，由来吴地说前朝；眼前多少不平事，愿与将军借宝刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":923,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张梦晋半身美人图","author":"唐寅","text":"天姿袅娜十分娇，可惜风流半节腰；却恨画工无见识，动人情处不曾描。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":924,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈石田壑舟图","author":"唐寅","text":"洞庭有奇士，楼室栖云霞；窗榻类画舫，山水清且嘉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":925,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题拈花微笑图","author":"唐寅","text":"昨夜海棠初着雨，数朵轻盈娇欲语。\n佳人晓起出兰房，折来对镜比红妆。\n问郎花好奴颜好，郎道不如花窈窕。\n佳人见语发娇嗔，不信死花胜活人。\n将花揉碎掷郎前，请郎今夜伴花眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":926,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首","author":"唐寅","text":"骑驴八月下蓝关，借宿南州白塔湾。\n壁上残灯千里梦，月中飞叶四更天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画十首 其七","author":"唐寅","text":"平村泉石足幽栖，暖着田衣饱青藜。\n坐看鸡虫笑庄子，劳劳齐物物难齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首","author":"唐寅","text":"东崦荷花西崦菱，大船渔网小船罨。\n我依住处真堪画，借问旁人到未曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首","author":"唐寅","text":"白袷檀冠碧玉环，倒骑驴子看庐山。\n腰间小榼藏何物，几转芙蓉一颗丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首","author":"唐寅","text":"天风缥缈约飞泉，千尺晴红拂紫烟。\n遥见树木车暂息，高蟠潸石与盘桓。","collection":"明","notice":"",